package parse

import "std/fs"
import "oi/skills/compile-oi/internal/model"

func Source(path fs.Path, content text, version model.LanguageVersion) model.SourceFile {
    return [the unique model.SourceFile represented by exact source {content} at {path} under {version},
        containing only source-local facts: package and imports; every ordinary declaration with parameter,
        result, export, and complete structural type shapes for every Oi 0.0.1 type form, where every type node carries its
        zero-based element path plus an origin containing the exact introducer or named token, source path, line, column, location,
        and physical order; anonymous slice, optional, struct, enum, task, outcome, channel, sender, and receiver nodes keep
        their own token origin, every declaration underlying root has an empty node path, and declaration underlying nodes keep
        declaration-source origins for later alias expansion and path rebasing at a named use; every type reference with its
        location; lowercase main entries; unresolved calls with an ID equal to their exact call location, exact callee-token SourcePosition,
        argument count, known argument shapes
        or the producer call ID for an exact source-local value flow, result use, and contextual result
        target shape or target producer-call ID, plus ordered task, await, capture, index, or field result transforms; every effect declaration's
        ordered `uses` clauses as AuthorityUse values containing the declaration name, exact authority, and authority-token SourcePosition;
        every `capture(expression)` whose complete expression is one syntactic call emits exactly one OptionalBoundary.DirectCapture containing
        the lexical caller, the operand CallSite ID, and capture-token SourcePosition; nested calls and effects reached through an ordinary
        function operand emit no additional boundary, and whether the operand resolves to an effect remains compile work; explicit or
        implicit conversion target plus a known source shape or
        source producer-call ID; runtime-handle
        type uses and their syntactic placement, excluding a direct channel-payload node that the construction already records;
        each channel construction in ascending physical order with a source-local ID and owner, provenance-bearing structural payload,
        and its capacity expression's exact token, structured position, compile-time-constant flag, and integer value when constant;
        every receiver use in owner/function physical order with Create, Direct, Assignment, or Argument kind, owner, source holder,
        destination holder, structured position, direct-owner, ordinary-function, or attached-oi consumer scope, unresolved consumer target,
        and zero-based argument index; channel receiver creation emits Create with empty source, its stable receiver identity, and its endpoint as
        destination; every directly receiver-typed ordinary or attached-oi parameter emits Create at its binding with a stable activation-local
        identity and the parameter as destination before body uses; direct use has empty destination; assignment moves from its exact right holder to left holder; a receiver argument moves to
        a stable destination key made only from its exact call ID and argument index after compile resolves that consumer parameter as receiver;
        every field unused by a use kind is its exact empty or zero value;
        every `detach oi QualifiedName(arguments)` and `handoff QualifiedName(arguments)` in physical order as one TransferUse,
        with exact kind, lexical owner, symbolic source owner equal to that owner, TransferDestinationKind.HostRegistry and destination
        `host/task-registry` for detach, or TransferDestinationKind.NamedActivation and the named target as destination for handoff, exact named
        target and target token, statement token, and ordered arguments; each transfer argument carries its exact source-local
        type shape or producer call ID, expression position, and TransferDurability.Durable only for a fully known recursively durable shape,
        TransferDurability.RuntimeHandle for a source-local task, channel, sender, or receiver occurrence, otherwise
        TransferDurability.Unresolved; a known handle records its first exact handle-expression token and position as RuntimeHandleOrigin;
        transfer target calls remain in Calls for ordinary declaration, signature, and reachability resolution, but a handle occurrence represented
        by a TransferArgument is excluded from RuntimeHandleUses;
        every call lexically resolved through an exact `std/task` import to `task.Status` or `task.Cancel` as one TaskIntrinsicUse, with its exact
        kind, lexical owner, qualified target, call ID, source holder, single Argument fact, argument position, call position, and source-local
        handle owner when that owner is provable from the value flow; these calls remain in Calls, while their handle arguments are excluded
        from RuntimeHandleUses;
        shard uses; manifest requirements; and only those
        parse or type facts decidable without resolving another source, all with exact locations; main is absent
        from declarations; StaticFacts never contain INVALID_CHANNEL_CAPACITY, RUNTIME_HANDLE_PAYLOAD, RECEIVER_ALREADY_MOVED,
        ENDPOINT_SCOPE_ESCAPE, INVALID_TASK_OWNER, or UNMAPPED_EFFECT;
        for Oi0_0_1, an imperative semantic block emits IMPERATIVE_SEMANTIC_BLOCK in phase parse at its first imperative
        semantic item, with that first token as Detail, matching the exact frozen 0.0.1 classification;
        for Oi0_0_2 only, recognize the exact 0.0.2 grammar additions, but emit at most the first deterministic bootstrap capability
        fact COMPILER_COLLECTION_UNAVAILABLE in phase type at the canonical first map or set token with exact token detail, or
        COMPILER_DERIVATION_UNAVAILABLE in phase type at the canonical first derive token with detail derive; emit neither for
        Oi0_0_1, and do not misclassify a recognized 0.0.2 collection as UNSUPPORTED_TYPE;
        duplicate, name, call, conversion, handle, transfer-target, transfer-durability, task-intrinsic, receiver-parameter, affine-flow,
        phase, authority, and shard resolution
        are not performed here; an argument is unknown with no producer only when it is an untyped literal whose
        type comes entirely from its resolved consumer parameter];
}
